     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ずじまい: without managing to do it",
     "texto": [
      "To say that, in the end, something wasn't done and there was no chance left: the ない form without い + **ず じまい**: **けっきょく、 その みせ に いかず じまい でした** (in the end I never got to go to that shop).",
      "The verb する becomes **せず じまい**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A feeling of regret",
     "texto": [
      "It expresses that what was wanted was not achieved.",
      "It sounds like resignation or lament."
